        "flows": [
          "RSC request: `app/board/page.tsx` → `app/board/_server/load-board.ts` → authenticate actor/request context → `work-items/server.ts` loads actor-visible work-items → `labels/server.ts` loads the referenced labels visible to that actor → `board-policy.ts` removes archived items, groups by status, attaches visible label details, and rejects missing/invisible label references → page renders the final board projection.",
